    "paragraph": "I'm a Geomatics Engineering graduate from Tribhuvan University with experience in drone surveying, GIS, GNSS, 3D modeling and 360° mapping. My work includes high-resolution mapping with Airlift Technology, drone-delivery assistance and flood-impact mapping on Mt. Manaslu, and field capture and virtual tours with Galli Maps. I've also handled drone-delivery operations following the Rasuwa-Bhotekoshi flood in Nepal, operating DJI FlyCart 100 and FlyCart 30 drones. Alongside WebGIS development, I combine fieldwork and spatial analysis to support infrastructure, environmental assessment and disaster response."
